rded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_method: Series where V4 and V5 routed to different players; compare observed PPP (n>=5 each).\n- observed_verdict: inconclusive\n- observed_failure_type: A_unanswerable\n- auto_confidence: high (0.95)"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-036", "score": 0.13, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-036 | Study family SF-APPS-036: Player-level BEST vs AVOID PPP gap (initiators, 55-series)\n- observed_research_question: Player-level BEST vs AVOID PPP gap (initiators, 55-series)\n- auto_outcome_status: supported\n- observed_hypothesis: The team-level BEST vs AVOID gap holds when H2 possessions are filtered to initiating player.\n- observed_result: Mean gap (n>=10 each tier) +0.427 PPP. Mean BEST 1.347 (38 players) vs AVOID 0.920 (94 players). Stars mean gap +0.542 (n=15) vs role +0.428 (n=16). Only 3 players clear n>=30 both tiers (all BOS: White +0.864, Brown +0. [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: D_positive (no failure: positive result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Pooled player gap +0.427 in the same direction as the team gap; most star cells are below the n>=30 gate.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 38/94 players at n>=15; only 3 at n>=30 both tiers\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPA-058", "score": 0.096, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPA-058 | Study family SF-APPA-058: Season stability of top suppressors and negative teammate pairs\n- observed_research_question: Season stability of top suppressors and negative teammate pairs\n- auto_outcome_status: rejected\n- observed_hypothesis: Each star's top sequential suppressor is stable across seasons, and some teammate X->Y sequences have large negative premiums.\n- observed_result: 2/30 (7%) stable (>=75% same top suppressor): D. Mitchell PUTBACK 75%, L. James POST_UP 75%. Negative: J. Tatum->K. Porzingis DRIVE->SPOT_UP -0.444 n=31; Giannis->Lillard DRIVE->PNR -0.263 n=31; J. Brown->J. Tatum SPOT_U [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: B_powered_null (adequately powered null result)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:small_sample\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:SAMPLE_SIZE_POWER\n- observed_failure_evidence: Only 2/30 stars meet the 75% same-top-suppressor stability rule.\n- observed_sample_and_power: 30 stars x 4 seasons; min n=20/cell\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- observed_verdict: null"}], "n_results": 4}

